<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial">Thank you for contacting us regarding the status of your application.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Once your application status has changed to <b>In Review</b>, your application file is complete and in evaluation for admission. Application evaluations typically take four to six weeks before an admission decision is made.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Your application status will be updated on <a href="http://my.asu.edu/">My ASU</a> as soon as an admission decision is made.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Please let me know if you have any additional questions about the admission process.</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>